{"4474590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HUSH", "steam_appid": 4474590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/77ebfc3ac9d68f0babb130d09a73863b.avif?t=1775049098\" width=829 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUSH - co-op action horror in neon 80s style. Barge into houses filled with monsters and smash their beloved belongings - because you're getting paid for it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/959c897b3ada1640194c7524df88e91c.poster.avif?t=1775049098\" width=540 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/959c897b3ada1640194c7524df88e91c.webm?t=1775049098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/959c897b3ada1640194c7524df88e91c.mp4?t=1775049098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/9ac8a866e10fb728a0cac847c6e0b0ad.avif?t=1775049098\" width=829 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living Cursed Things</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know how an object you want to break will react. A toilet might start running away from you, a statue could suddenly start screaming loudly, and a gas cylinder might explode at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/d562dc3cb6eedfe33286064e3e2f66d1.poster.avif?t=1775049098\" width=540 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/d562dc3cb6eedfe33286064e3e2f66d1.webm?t=1775049098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/d562dc3cb6eedfe33286064e3e2f66d1.mp4?t=1775049098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/77ebfc3ac9d68f0babb130d09a73863b.avif?t=1775049098\" width=829 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don’t Hide - Run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of sneaky stealth, you'll be making noise, panicking as you flee, and trying to shake off or confuse the monster. Noise is danger. Noise is money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/5c04ee7400b29410f7fe9cd865d9b799.poster.avif?t=1775049098\" width=540 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/5c04ee7400b29410f7fe9cd865d9b799.webm?t=1775049098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/5c04ee7400b29410f7fe9cd865d9b799.mp4?t=1775049098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/9903b5104dd2be20dec14106ebe52512.avif?t=1775049098\" width=829 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch Your Friend's Backs</strong> <br>On your own, you'll be an easy target. But what if one player distracts the monster while another smashes its ancient vases? A loyal friend could save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/24b374bdcb75ddedd8f4102e7221a8ba.poster.avif?t=1775049098\" width=540 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/24b374bdcb75ddedd8f4102e7221a8ba.webm?t=1775049098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/24b374bdcb75ddedd8f4102e7221a8ba.mp4?t=1775049098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/77ebfc3ac9d68f0babb130d09a73863b.avif?t=1775049098\" width=829 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUSH - co-op action horror in neon 80s style. Barge into houses filled with monsters and smash their beloved belongings - because you're getting paid for it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/959c897b3ada1640194c7524df88e91c.poster.avif?t=1775049098\" width=540 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/959c897b3ada1640194c7524df88e91c.webm?t=1775049098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474590/extras/959c897b3ada1640194c7524df88e91c.mp4?t=1